+// A reaction-coloured silhouette outline on the unit under the cursor.
+//
+// A port of WarcraftXL/wxl-unit-outline at 4e8123e (src/Outline.cpp). Shaders, passes, colours, spread
+// and intensity are the module's; what changed is how it reaches the game: the unit under the cursor,
+// the player, the reaction and the model chain are read from the client's own objects, and the three
+// render points are called by the engine (Engine/Source/Gx/RenderHooks.h) instead of hooked. Only the
+// unit under the cursor is outlined; the module's outline of the current target is left out.
